project/modelpool-useglobalmaterialpool-off: ModelPool useGlobalMaterialPool (default ON) consolidates many meshes onto ONE shared tier material via getMaterialForTier -> every part renders the SAME texture. spoint models are individually textured; construct ModelPool({useGlobalMaterialPool:false}) to keep each mesh's real material/texture. Witnessed sillos 96 meshes -> 45 unique materials after the fix.